# Logging (`base/logging.h`)

Product C++ under **`ui/`**, **`base/`**, and **`examples/`** uses Chromium logging.

```cpp
#include "base/logging.h"

LOG(INFO) << "attached hwnd";
LOG(ERROR) << "host failed: " << message;
DLOG(WARNING) << "debug-only note";
```

## Don’t

- Don’t add `fprintf` / `printf` / `std::cerr` / `OutputDebugString` for new diagnostics in touched product TUs.
- Don’t introduce smartgis `LOGGING(...)` or `base/core/log.h`. That header is not in this repo.
- Don’t log secrets or full document payloads.

`third_party/` and `skia/` keep their own logs.
